{"id":"conv_03799","context":"Friends discuss a near-accident from yesterday","ambient":"cafe_quiet_chatter","cast":["ren_uni","riku_teen"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Listen, last night I seriously thought I was going to die.","jp":"聞いてよ、昨夜マジで死ぬかと思った。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[4,8,9,16,21,68,99,107,296,1017,2677,4123,4605],"jpTokens":[{"s":"聞い","r":"きい","w":1017},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"、"},{"s":"昨夜","r":"さくや","w":4605},{"s":"マジ","w":4123},{"s":"で","w":21},{"s":"死ぬ","r":"しぬ","w":2677},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"思っ","r":"おもっ","w":99},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"riku_teen","mood":null,"en":"Huh, what happened? Are you okay?","jp":"え、何があったの？大丈夫？","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,6,8,22,70,711,1529],"jpTokens":[{"s":"え","w":711},{"s":"、"},{"s":"何","r":"なに","w":70},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"あっ","w":22},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"？"},{"s":"大丈夫","r":"だいじょうぶ","w":1529},{"s":"？"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"I was going down a hill on my bike, and a metal rod was lying right in front of me.","jp":"自転車で坂下りてたら、目の前に金属の棒が落ちててさ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,4,6,7,8,25,82,101,136,139,1496,1989,4241,4622,5108,5581,14380],"jpTokens":[{"s":"自転車","r":"じてんしゃ","w":1989},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"坂","r":"さか","w":5581},{"s":"下り","r":"くだり","w":14380},{"s":"て","w":139},{"s":"たら","w":8},{"s":"、"},{"s":"目","r":"め","w":136},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"前","r":"まえ","w":101},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"金属","r":"きんぞく","w":4241},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"棒","r":"ぼう","w":5108},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"落ち","r":"おち","w":4622},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"て","w":139},{"s":"さ","w":25},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"riku_teen","mood":null,"en":"Whoa, and then? Did you crash into it?","jp":"うわ、それで？ぶつかったの？","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,8,2062,2337,3839,8653,8966,9919,13652,14361],"jpTokens":[{"s":"うわ","w":8966},{"s":"、"},{"s":"それで","w":2062},{"s":"？"},{"s":"ぶつかっ","w":14361},{"s":"た","